        a                      owl:Ontology ;
        rdfs:comment           "Human model built 2026-11-16 by ISS transfer from mouse gomodel:6ab067da00013223 (same structure, 12 activities). Mouse experimental evidence -> ISS (ECO:0000250, GO_REF:0000024) with the mouse MGI id(s) of the source gene(s); AMPK complex (GO:0031588) with Prkaa1 MGI:MGI:2145955 | Prkaa2 MGI:MGI:1336173. Rat ISS (RGD) and IC lines kept unchanged. Mouse ISS lines from human proteins replaced by human experimental references: GCG/GCGR/GNAS IDA PMID:32193322 (Qiao 2020); GCGR plasma membrane IDA PMID:9287038 (Buggy 1997); GNAS has input ADCY6 and GNAS -> ADCY6 IDA PMID:17110384 (Gao 2007); PRKACA nucleus IDA PMID:21085490; AMPK cytoplasm IDA GO_REF:0000052 (HPA, PRKAA1 cytosol); CPT2 enabled by IDA PMID:20538056 (Violante 2010); PPARA has input CPT1A and PPARA -> CPT1A IDA PMID:16271724 (Napal 2005; abstract only, full text not checked). Open: CPT2 has output palmitoyl-CoA has no evidence (Violante 2010 assayed the reverse reaction; no human forward-reaction paper found). Full evidence rationale: comments of gomodel:6ab067da00013223." , "Curated with GO AI HUB. Human glucagon-GCGR-cAMP/PKA and AMPK signalling to CPT1A-dependent mitochondrial fatty acid beta-oxidation, transferred by ISS from mouse gomodel:6ab067da00013223 with human experimental evidence where available." ;
